    {
      "id": "p0041-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby's fondness for RPGs leads him to tools like RPG Maker, which allow users to create their own games without any programming knowledge. While in middle school, he begins creating his own small RPGs inspired by his favorite games. Most of his early projects are never finished, but he learns firsthand just how difficult it is to create large-scale games.",
        "raw": "Toby's fondness for RPGs leads him to tools like RPG Maker, which allow users\nto create their own games without any programming knowledge. While in\nmiddle school, he begins creating his own small RPGs inspired by his favorite\ngames. Most of his early projects are never finished, but he learns firsthand just\nhow difficult it is to create large-scale games.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09674732,
          0.09312143,
          0.70572526,
          0.17702857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09471204,
          0.09240714,
          0.70776055,
          0.1781
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "对角色扮演游戏的喜爱，让 Toby 接触到 RPG Maker 之类的工具，即使不懂编程，也能制作游戏。中学时，他受自己喜爱的作品启发，开始制作小型角色扮演游戏。早期项目大多没能完成，却让他亲身体会到做大型游戏有多难。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 31,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
